body:
No calculator is permitted.

The polynomial p(x)=x⁴−5x²+4 has which complete set of real zeros?

A. {−4,−1,1,4}
B. {−2,−1,1,2}
C. {−2,−1,1}
D. {−2,1,2}

Choices:
A. {−4,−1,1,4}
B. {−2,−1,1,2}
C. {−2,−1,1}
D. {−2,1,2}

